[[Simon Judeau]], under the mysterious alias of "the Professor," left the [[Huntik Foundation]] in order to find a cure for the [[Curse of the Legendary Titans]] and founded the Organization practically overnight in New Years 1959. He began building an army of followers through the use of the Legendary Titan of Mind, [[Araknos|Araknos']], mind control abilities. 

In order to cover up how quickly he built an army of international agents, Judeau also falsified the history of the Organization, so as to make it seem as if the Organization had existed for hundreds of years, corrupting national governments and royal courts before making itself known in April 1959. This was told to every new agent, with none questioning the truth of this story. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}} 

The truth about the Organization was discovered by [[Zhalia Moon]] after hacking into the Organization's extensive data archive and the Huntik team were able to work out who true identity of the Professor. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}} 

After the fall of the Professor, the Organization was taken over and led by [[Wilder]], who always used dirty tricks and hated to get his hands dirty. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}

Grier later took over the Organization by taking Wilder as a hostage on [[Sutos Island]]. As Grier believed in order more then dominance and was a very honorable man, it is possible that the current goals of the Organization may have changed. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}

Wilder eventually escaped and set up base beneath [[Shuri Castle]] in Japan, and continued to plot with the members of his Organization team. {{source|The Guardian of Yonaguni}}
